  "rules": [
    "Only buy while the hourly close is above the 200-hour EMA.",
    "Buy when the stochastic %K (14, 3, 3) crosses back up through 20, out of oversold.",
    "Put the stop at the last swing low (5 hourly candles each side) and the target at 2 times the risk.",
    "Risking the same 20 USDT per trade: a stop closer than 1% is widened to 1% and one wider than 15% is cut to 15%, so a position never passes 2,000 USDT.",
    "Hold one position per coin at a time."
  ],
  "notExpressed": [
    "The video names no stochastic settings or oversold level: the test uses 14, 3, 3 and 20, the common defaults",
    "The nearest swing low as the trader sees it: the test takes the last low confirmed by 5 hourly candles on each side",
    "The variant that also waits for a MACD cross while the stochastic is oversold",
    "The source trades its own chart timeframe on forex or stocks; the test runs it on hourly crypto candles",
    "Short trades below the 200 EMA (the test is spot, long only)"
  ],
